to make a project that will create tons of buzz in just one try."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's an ordinary college student with no special strengths. Thinking that she has nothing she excels at, this has become a complex for her. She had nothing in particular that she wanted to achieve and was just living a self-indulgent university life. But when she one day stumbled across the three members of \"Nana Channel\" being supported by tons of people and shining, she thought to herself she wanted to be just like them and so started streaming videos."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her goal is to collaborate with Nana Channel."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c129922"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/83ee0141c1f9af909bdbcf2b3b4a7fe3f875e2fad1b754cbdd7f7cb7328e7759.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/1130f6b1dd616e0df1e5fcfc167c28b22350ec08347e9d25807843c2a9136074.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"Lynn","creatorId":"vndb:s27021","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s27021","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s27021","name":"Lynn","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95850","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c129923","characterName":"柊 藍那","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c129923"},"originalCharacterName":"柊 藍那","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A college student at the same university as Asami and Miyabi. She's their junior by one year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a very indoorsy net and game-enthusiast and lives life at her own pace. She's mainly responsible for video editing since she has extensive knowledge of how to operate a PC."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She first got acquainted with Himari and Miyabi when helping them when they were having trouble with video editing at the university. Himari then forcibly recruited her as a member."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Himari and Miyabi dote on her like a sister, but..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c129923"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e928e3ac1fd3b8d3af55823120bb6e9b2812159b3d4534f034d5551a5ff8d00.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c664e7b9860ec3b4faa12c960d460b3136645a9523aa19ea0b54816566fa2db8.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"真野 あゆみ","creatorId":"vndb:s18145","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s18145","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18145","name":"真野 あゆみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95849","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c129924","characterName":"姫宮 雅","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c129924"},"originalCharacterName":"姫宮 雅","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A college student at the same university and year as Himari."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's the youngest child of a wealthy family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Surprisingly, she's a good cook and family-oriented. However, she doesn't think that this is something to be proud of."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She gradually starts becoming fascinated by Himari isn't afraid to get into her personal space and they become good friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's semi-forced into streaming videos with Himari."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first, she had little interest in video streaming, but now she enjoys it even though she complains about it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c129924"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c47a545c27d0f8d81826f19fd6ffb8e1301ce8f719273937c4d3130ffacdbf6e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14c522bb2b299e878294151a68fb3274eeb303e524d8de7aec6e588a59d41906.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山本 希望","creatorId":"vndb:s1455","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1455","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1455","name":"山本 希望","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95848","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c129925","characterName":"???","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c129925"},"originalCharacterName":"???","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A monkey mascot suddenly appears before Himari and her friends as they shoot a video at the abandoned shopping mall."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It will repeatedly attack them as they try to escape!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c129925"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16311cc272614b1c4ff4cdb0ebda1b636f73f46c0ce571602b1645ff695a1878.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd5cefa894dabd21aad0757e0306171c622976e8103c9888a1e4c5e97b4ff320.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c97310","characterName":"生駒 美桜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c97310"},"originalCharacterName":"生駒 美桜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A member of the livestreaming group Nana Channel."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After seeing how withdrawn and lonely she seems, Nana and Asuka invite the friendless Mio to join their livestreaming channel."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While overcoming some of her shyness after joining in on the two's videos, she still prefers to work behind the scenes, without appearing on camera."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the hotel, disregarding the risk to her own life, Mio rouses herself to save her friends Nana and Asuka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c97310"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/88f6304791012882b304dbcc35bc99e084b98bc67ecd6782bb0777f22316eebf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36c546a36364ac359ea67edd55c21378079830151dad09323f506aa7b1818eb0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c97311","characterName":"桜井 奈々","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c97311"},"originalCharacterName":"桜井 奈々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The face and founder of Nana Channel. Coming up with a plan to shoot a video in an abandoned hotel, she becomes the instigator of the livestream shoot in the abandoned hotel ruins."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she originally started streaming reaction videos as a hobby, as her audience grew, she became more conscious of the number of views on her videos."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The filming and planning of her current videos reflects her new-found resolve that anything goes as long as it gets views. (Mio and Azusa always stop her before she goes too far.)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her goal is to reach one million subscribers!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c97311"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93eb63ec020ee7d0fb719cae3a51abc72420ca744519f9980af59214f8f9d5af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/3607b165d30d4cda240ce140fcac2c2f698b747b5958d6a037240e656a5f4711.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c97312","characterName":"白石 梓","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c97312"},"originalCharacterName":"白石 梓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Gifted with brain, brawns, and beauty. She has a large number of female fans. She has been friends with Nana for years, and the two are now inseparable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At Nana's request, Azusa started helping with video editing and filming, but once Nana got it into her head to start raising her female follower count, Azusa was dragged into appearing in videos as well. Ever since, Azusa has been making more and more appearances in Nana's videos."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With a cool and mature exterior, she is the channel's mediator."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For some reason, she doesn